   notice at firmware/components/wireguard_lwip/src/crypto/refc/x25519-license.txt
   (Copyright (c) 2015-2016 Cryptography Research, Inc.). The Cortex-M0
   Curve25519 assembly in src/crypto/cortex/ is from the μNaCl project
